  "evidence": "TEXT_F: Maintain NATO commitment and spend at least 2% of GDP on defence; renew the nuclear deterrent; support veterans; recruit additional police and PCSOs and restore neighbourhood policing; Health spending to rise by 4.3% annually; create a National Care Service with free personal care and better pay/conditions; end rough sleeping in five years; establish a Right to Food; support a just transition for energy workers; bring energy and water into public ownership. TEXT_C: Cancel Trident replacement and end arms export promotion; replace prohibition with regulated drug policy including cannabis legalisation, heroin-assisted treatment, safe consumption rooms, and pardons; humane immigration system and end detention centres; proportional representation and citizens’ assemblies; Universal Basic Income; strong purity-inflected environmental measures (ban most harmful pesticides, moratorium on GM, restrict flight advertising) and cancel HS2.",
